<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>US5051183A - Microporous polyolefin membrane and method of producing same 
        - Google Patents</title>

    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="referrer" content="origin-when-crossorigin">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US5051183A/en">
    <meta name="description" content="
     A microporous polyolefin membrane made of a polyolefin composition containing 1 weight % or more of an ultra-high-molecular-weight polyolefin having a weight-average molecular weight of 7x105 or more and having a weight-average molecular weight/number-average molecular weight ratio of 10-300, the microporous membrane having a thickness of 0.1-25  mu m, a porosity of 35-95%, an average pore diameter of 0.001-0.2  mu m and a breaking strength of 0.2 kg or more per 15 mm width is produced by (a) preparing a solution comprising 10-50 weight % of the polyolefin composition and 50-90 weight % of a solvent; (b) extruding the solution through a die; (c) cooling the extruded solution to form a gel-like article; (d) stretching the gel-like article at a temperature equal to or lower than a melting point of the polyolefin composition &#43;10 DEG  C; and (e) removing the remaining solvent. 
   
   ">
    <meta name="DC.type" content="patent">
    <meta name="DC.title" content="Microporous polyolefin membrane and method of producing same 
       ">
    <meta name="DC.date" content="1990-09-20" scheme="dateSubmitted">
